"_source": "TCVN3 (VSCII-3, \"ABC\" fonts such as .VnTime / .VnTimeH): byte code -> Vietnamese letter(s). Derived from the character order and byte values of the TCVN3 table in Unikey (ibus-unikey ukengine/data.cpp) and checked against https://vietunicode.sourceforge.net/charset/ and Wikipedia \"VSCII\". Facts about the encoding only. In .VnTime a byte shows the lower-case letter (A1-A7 the capitals A-breve, A-circumflex, E-circumflex, O-circumflex, O-horn, U-horn, D-stroke); in .VnTimeH every byte shows the capital.",
